.git
# Local-only trees (tests/deploy/test_dockerignore.py): agent worktrees are full checkouts with
# their own node_modules and .venv, and made every build send gigabytes to the daemon.
.claude
.data
evals/reports
.venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
infra/terraform/**/.terraform
docs
